  "name": "OJ4OCRMT",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOJ4OCRMT: A Large Multilingual Dataset for OCR-MT Evaluation\n\t\n\nCheck out the Paper:\n\"OJ4OCRMT: A Large Multilingual Dataset for OCR-MT Evaluation\" Paul McNamee, Kevin Duh, Cameron Carpenter, Ron Colaianni, Nolan King, and Kenton Murray.  Proceedings of Machine Translation Summit XX, Vol. 1: Research Track June 23-27, 2025, Geneva, Switzerland.\nThe OJ4OCRMT dataset contains source PDF files, rendered images in\nthree resolutions, and text files (both raw extractions, and\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/hltcoe/OJ4OCRMT.",
